; A cost spec that repeats a component keeps all of them when formatted.
2020-01-01 open Assets:I
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "buy"
  Assets:I  1 HOOL {100 USD, 200 USD, "a", "b", 2020-01-01, 2020-01-02}
  Assets:C   -100 USD

2020-01-03 * "merge"
  Assets:I    1 HOOL {*, 100 USD, *}
  Assets:C  -100.00 USD
